{"uuid":"834647d2-fb7d-4fe4-99aa-54e2088483df","parentUuid":"f993793c-4b42-4c64-89be-65c65bb078f4","sessionId":"session-a53e802d-bec7-4eec-862d-0de3afece23c","timestamp":"2026-01-04T06:22:11.857Z","type":"assistant","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","message":{"id":"response-1767507731855","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<think>\nThe user sent \"llll\" - this seems like a simple greeting or test message. I should respond in a friendly, concise way in Chinese since that's their preference.\n</think>\n\n你好！我是心流 CLI，很高兴为你服务。\n\n我看到你在 Android Termux 环境下工作，项目目录包含多个子项目（web、market、utils 等）以及一些 Coze 工作流和 AI 相关资源。\n\n有什么我可以帮你的吗？"}],"model":"minimax-m2.1","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
