{"uuid":"bf078be3-abc9-4ac9-aece-11195eebd59d","parentUuid":"a004141c-7928-4849-aa32-93b3bd8648d3","sessionId":"session-a53e802d-bec7-4eec-862d-0de3afece23c","timestamp":"2026-01-04T06:29:17.625Z","type":"assistant","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","message":{"id":"response-1767508157625","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<think>\nThe user is asking about switching sessions in Termux. They probably want to know how to switch between different tmux sessions or different Termux sessions. Let me provide a concise answer about session switching.\n</think>\n\n## Termux 切换 Session\n\n### tmux 会话切换\n\n```bash\n# 查看所有会话\ntmux ls\n\n# 切换到指定会话\ntmux attach -t 会话名\n\n# 切换会话（tmux 内）\nCtrl+b 然后按 s  # 列出所有会话并选择\n```\n\n### 新建/分离会话\n```bash\ntmux new -s myname        # 新建命名会话\nCtrl+b 然后按 d           # 分离会话（退出不关闭）\ntmux attach -t myname     # 重新连接会话\n```\n\n### screen 会话切换\n```bash\nscreen -ls                # 查看所有会话\nscreen -r 会话名          # 重新连接会话\n```\n\n### 快速操作\n```bash\n# 在会话间快速切换\nCtrl+b 然后按 n          # 下一个窗口\nCtrl+b 然后按 p          # 上一个窗口\n```\n\n---\n\n需要我帮你配置更详细的环境吗？"}],"model":"minimax-m2.1","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}}}
